    {
      "bbox": [
        101,
        936,
        1606,
        1217
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In June 1963 some thirty City Departments were placed on a unified, eastern, direct dialing system that afforded better and faster service to the public in its communications with City offices. This new communications system, known as Centrex, provided the City with its own Central Office. In addition, telephone extension became a private telephone, and may be reached by direct dialing of 566 followed by the four digit extension number, or the caller is still able to reach his party with the assistance of the City's own telephone operators.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.3264,
          "min": -1.5444
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 110,
          "mean": -0.0623,
          "min": -2.2398
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 8556,
        "area_px": 385251,
        "density": 0.02221,
        "chars": 546,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 63.81
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        101,
        1246,
        1506,
        1424
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "With the new system, the public is able to reach City personnel by dialing the number and directly. If the called telephone, dialed directly, is busy, the call does not answer, there is no charge for the call. At present, incoming calls to your agency goes through a switchboard. Under the CENTREX system, most calls will be dialed directly.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2084,
          "min": -1.3853
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 76,
          "mean": -0.0468,
          "min": -0.6594
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 4947,
        "area_px": 227688,
        "density": 0.02173,
        "chars": 341,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 68.93
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        101,
        1451,
        1566,
        1585
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "A telephone traffic survey has disclosed that calls to City Departments, at peak traffic hours, 75 per cent of the callers had sufficient information so that their calls could easily have been dialed directly by the extension.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1996,
          "min": -1.3865
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 43,
          "mean": -0.009,
          "min": -0.1675
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 2969,
        "area_px": 179685,
        "density": 0.01652,
        "chars": 226,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 76.12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        101,
        1621,
        1550,
        1760
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The second phase of the work of installing the CENTREX telephone system covering more City locations south of Canal Street, is expected to be started about June 1, 1964 and be completed on a progressive basis. Your Department will be included in Phase II.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1831,
          "min": -1.067
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 55,
          "mean": -0.0468,
          "min": -1.0182
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 3972,
        "area_px": 182785,
        "density": 0.02173,
        "chars": 255,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 64.2
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        101,
        1794,
        1626,
        2005
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "A representative of the Telephone Company and the Department of Public Works will be visiting your department in the very near future to survey your present telephone equipment, and ask various questions of each extension user. The main purpose of such a visit is to insure the smoothness of the conversion from one system to the other. I request you give them your complete cooperation.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.199,
          "min": -1.3774
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
